   "phrasing": "greet_24",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm doing great.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 0.73,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_18"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "The invitation says plus one, and I've been seeing someone for like three weeks.",
   "est_sec": 4.44,
   "gap_before": 0.58,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "wedding_planning.ctx7"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Ooh, early days. Bring them along, or go solo and save the big family event for later?",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.94,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "wedding_planning.ctx7",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, give me a bit, someone's at my door. Wait quietly until I say I'm back.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.77,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "side_conversation",
   "phrasing": "side_instr_09"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Sure, take your time.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.45,
   "role": "ack",
   "phrasing": "ack_03",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Sofia, what did you do with your old laptop when you upgraded?",
   "est_sec": 3.82,
   "gap_before": 0.89,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "friend_question",
   "block": "laptop_buying.side5"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "Sold it online. Got about a third of what I paid.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 0.62,
   "block": "laptop_buying.side5"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Was it a hassle?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.23,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "friend_question",
   "block": "laptop_buying.side5"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "A bit. I had to wipe it properly and answer like twenty questions from buyers.",
   "est_sec": 4.75,
   "gap_before": 0.59,
   "block": "laptop_buying.side5"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hmm. Maybe I'll just give mine to my niece.",
   "est_sec": 2.89,
   "gap_before": 2.8,
   "block": "laptop_buying.side5"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "friend",
   "text": "That's nicer anyway. She'll use it for school.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 1.2,
   "block": "laptop_buying.side5"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, where were we?",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.93,
   "event": "return_cue",
   "kind": "implicit",
   "phrasing": "implicit_04"
  },
